    "body": "fix on issue/4061-wire-test-build · PR #4063: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/pull/4063 · pinned by all four `model_arcs::` tests and the full 22-test `wire_post` target · ready for independent review; the maintainer controls the merge.\n\nThe local target reproduced E0063 before the fix. The fixture now sets `lead_arc_radius: None`; no application code or assertions change. The final-head quick gate and focused strict clippy pass on `aee62345fb871199e89709d2aa4969d891f6d75e`.\n\nThe PR is open and non-draft. No CI checks are reported. The PR body discloses the unrun light, batch, heavy, catalog, and GUI checks. The release-mode light lane conflicts with the owner's bounded no-release-rebuild scope.\n\nGitHub denied label changes at claim time, so this comment records the review handoff without an `in-review` label. The automated issue stays open for the next green post-merge run.\n",
